  m_Name: Blood Room Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Welcome To The Blood Rooms
  - We have released a blood coloured mist in this room that will slowly damage you
    over time.
  - 'Evil mages roam these rooms. '
  - Exploding Zombies
  - Drink the blood in the fountains scattered around the lab to replenish your health.
  - Reach the red door to complete your training
